[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768825632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2768825632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2768825632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCO0g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T09:56:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:00:34Z","body":"Confirmed, also occurs in 4.5.dev1, ~will bisect~","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768825632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768833647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2768833647","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2768833647,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCQxv","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T09:59:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T09:59:24Z","body":"This seems to be intentional change from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102880","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768833647/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768856931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2768856931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2768856931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCWdj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T10:08:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:08:25Z","body":"For the reference, reverting it to not color emojis is simple (and won't affect the rest of the changes from aforementioned PR), but I guess it depend on what kind of SVG font are you using and for what purpose. Maybe it's better to add a font import flag to make in configurable.\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp b/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp\nindex 9715785575..62d0efb70e 100644\n--- a/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp\n+++ b/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp\n@@ -3800,7 +3800,7 @@ void TextServerAdvanced::_font_draw_glyph(const RID &p_font_rid, const RID &p_ca\n                if (fgl.texture_idx != -1) {\n                        Color modulate = p_color;\n #ifdef MODULE_FREETYPE_ENABLED\n-                       if (!fgl.from_svg && ffsd->face && ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image.is_valid() && (ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image->get_format() == Image::FORMAT_RGBA8) && !lcd_aa && !fd->msdf) {\n+                       if (ffsd->face && ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image.is_valid() && (ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image->get_format() == Image::FORMAT_RGBA8) && !lcd_aa && !fd->msdf) {\n                                modulate.r = modulate.g = modulate.b = 1.0;\n                        }\n #endif\ndiff --git a/modules/text_server_fb/text_server_fb.cpp b/modules/text_server_fb/text_server_fb.cpp\nindex c010a1242f..f4d150e064 100644\n--- a/modules/text_server_fb/text_server_fb.cpp\n+++ b/modules/text_server_fb/text_server_fb.cpp\n@@ -2741,7 +2741,7 @@ void TextServerFallback::_font_draw_glyph(const RID &p_font_rid, const RID &p_ca\n                if (fgl.texture_idx != -1) {\n                        Color modulate = p_color;\n #ifdef MODULE_FREETYPE_ENABLED\n-                       if (!fgl.from_svg && ffsd->face && ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image.is_valid() && (ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image->get_format() == Image::FORMAT_RGBA8) && !lcd_aa && !fd->msdf) {\n+                       if (ffsd->face && ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image.is_valid() && (ffsd->textures[fgl.texture_idx].image->get_format() == Image::FORMAT_RGBA8) && !lcd_aa && !fd->msdf) {\n                                modulate.r = modulate.g = modulate.b = 1.0;\n                        }\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768856931/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768948193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2768948193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2768948193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCsvh","user":{"login":"romlok","id":441188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok","html_url":"https://github.com/romlok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T10:44:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:44:22Z","body":"Yeah, I can see an argument for either way being the intended functionality.\nI do notice that the screenshots in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102880 seem to show that the previous behaviour also coloured emoji in certain cases (the last of the 4 lines in the before/after screenshots)?  But it's unclear to me what context each line of the example images represents 😕 \n\nRather than an import option, could it make sense for a toggle for this to be available as a `FontVariation` option?  Then the same font could be used in either manner, depending on the context (eg. a simulated green-screen terminal in one place, and regular text elsewhere).\n\nEither way, if a toggle isn't a trivial addition for the next point release, my preference would be to revert to the previous behaviour, at least for the 4.4 branch.\n\nFor labels at least, replicating the new behaviour can be done using `modulate`; whereas replicating the old behaviour introduces significant complexity, especially if the text is user-supplied or otherwise not known beforehand.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768948193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769030741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2769030741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2769030741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDA5V","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T11:20:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T11:20:19Z","body":"> For the reference, reverting it to not color emojis is simple (and won't affect the rest of the changes from aforementioned PR), but I guess it depend on what kind of SVG font are you using and for what purpose. Maybe it's better to add a font import flag to make in configurable.\n\nFor 4.4.2, I'd suggest committing the above diff to remove the behavior change, while keeping the rest of the bug fix. WDYT?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769030741/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769052448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2769052448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2769052448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDGMg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T11:29:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T11:29:19Z","body":"Indeed, for 4.4.2 it's probably better to just disable it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769052448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770319424","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104876#issuecomment-2770319424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104876","id":2770319424,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lH7hA","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T18:17:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T18:05:49Z","body":"My 2c. This was intentional for the simple reason that if you specify a modulate I think it should modulate (and the 3d path did that already). That said, I can see how this is bad for existing code. \nA SVG glyph doesn’t imply it’s a multi-color emoji. If there is a flag in the future, I don’t think it should be font wide, but allow unicode ranges. E.g. modulate exclusion for the emoticons range (U+1F600..U+1F64F), etc. On the other hand it's not hard to split font into color and no-color fonts.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770319424/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]